# Fakhra Panel — Caddy fronts ONLY the panel: one handle, reverse-proxied
# to the FastAPI backend on 127.0.0.1:8000. VPN traffic never touches
# caddy: Xray owns its inbound ports directly (REALITY on :443, etc.).
# Rendered by panel/caddy.py, which fills the two mode placeholders below
# (CADDY_GLOBAL_OPTIONS, CADDY_SITE_ADDRESS) — the entrypoint exports
# CADDY_PORT and, in auto-TLS mode, PUBLIC_HOST. The rendered file never
# carries secrets or a fixed port.
$CADDY_GLOBAL_OPTIONS
$CADDY_SITE_ADDRESS {
	handle {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8000
	}
}
